  "not_covered": "The SDK (libc, crt0, link.ld) is this repo's build; upstream llvm-mos-sdk has no merged SNES platform.",
  "sdk_pr_415": "The open upstream SNES target llvm-mos-sdk#415 (head e6a5c17cab52026cb66924a8e2bf5fab870536f2, read via the public API 2026-10-01) sets __stack = 0x0200, so its soft stack grows down into page 1 with the hardware stack; it has no soft-stack reservation or assertion either."
